[{"id":181085329,"discussion_id":"161419fc37bbeb08639ab0d00c29ca3cd92a588f","body":"#### 变更摘要\n\n此 PR 修复了 FlashAttn GS 布局下 `AttentionmaskCopyInForGsLayout` 函数中，当 `midGCount == 0` 时模板写入超出 UB buffer 边界导致相邻 mask 数据损坏的 bug。核心改动是将 `headS1Count` 和 `midGCount` 的计算前置到分支判断之前，在 `midGCount == 0` 场景回退到直接从 GM 两段拷贝的安全路径，同时修复了 `midGCount` 的 `uint32_t` 下溢问题，并为 `head` 的 `DataCopy` 增加了 `headS1Count > 0` 保护。两份 `attenmask_gs1.h`（`common` 与 `flash_attn`）同步修改。\n\n**主要改动**\n\n- **`headS1Count` 计算提前并修正语义**：原本在 `else` 分支内使用 `info.s1Size - s1StartIdx` 计算，现改为在 `if` 之前用 `(s1StartIdx == 0) ? 0 : (info.s1Size - s1StartIdx)`，兼容 `s1StartIdx == 0` 时无需 head 段的场景。\n\n- **`midGCount` 计算前置并修复下溢**：原 `else` 分支内 `remainRowCount / info.s1Size` 在 `gs1dealNum < headS1Count` 时产生 `uint32_t` 下溢，现改为三目运算 `(info.gs1dealNum > headS1Count) ? (info.gs1dealNum - headS1Count) / info.s1Size : 0`，并将计算提前至 `if` 条件中使用。\n\n- **`midGCount == 0` 回退到安全路径**：将 `if` 条件从 `gs1dealNum <= s1Size` 扩展为 `gs1dealNum <= s1Size || midGCount == 0`，使无完整 G 的场景直接从 GM 分段拷贝，避免 `else` 分支内模板写入越界。\n\n- **`head` 段 `DataCopy` 增加空保护**：`else` 分支中 `DataCopy(attenMaskUb, ...)` 外层增加 `if (headS1Count > 0)` 判断，避免 `headS1Count == 0` 时执行无意义的 UB 内拷贝。\n\n","created_at":"2026-07-22T10:51:53+08:00","updated_at":"2026-07-22T10:56:08+08:00","user":{"id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","login":"atomgit-bot","object_id":"672dd45c4ea6673461aa2102","name":"atomgit-bot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/fb/bb/88f9bbb284ce2dc057d85551b1bbe66acb35305ce59007d28029609b5e4b9652.png?time=1777513981052","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/atomgit-bot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":181085387,"discussion_id":"0266e342cab72a027c232177004f40926f82aff3","body":"Thanks for your pull-request.\nThe full list of commands accepted by me can be found at [**here**](https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/robot/robot%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97.md#-%E5%A6%82%E9%9C%80%E4%BA%86%E8%A7%A3%E8%AF%A6%E7%BB%86%E7%9A%84%E5%91%BD%E4%BB%A4%E5%8F%AF%E5%8F%82%E8%80%83%E4%B8%8